---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import FAQItem from '../components/FAQItem.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="FAQ | Static Pulse Sites"
  description="Answers about website development, AI systems, automation, custom internal software, pricing, ownership, and the Static Pulse Sites process."
>
  <main class="faq-page">

    <section class="faq-hero">
      <div class="container faq-hero-content">

        <h1>Questions about working with Static Pulse Sites</h1>

        <p class="hero-lead">
          You do not need to understand software, automation, or AI before
          contacting us. Start with the business problem, and we'll help
          identify the most practical next step.
        </p>

        <div class="button-row">
          <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/contact">
            Start Your Project
          </a>
        </div>

      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="faq-section">
      <div class="container">

        <div class="faq-section-heading">
          <h2>Services and project fit</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-group">

          <FAQItem
            question="What does Static Pulse Sites do?"
            answer="Static Pulse Sites is a Business Systems Studio. We help small and medium businesses improve their websites, connect disconnected tools, automate repetitive work, and build focused internal software."
          />

          <FAQItem
            question="How do I know which service I need?"
            answer="You do not need to decide that before contacting us. Explain the process, website, or operational problem you want to improve. We will review the situation and recommend the simplest appropriate solution."
          />

          <FAQItem
            question="Can the three services be combined?"
            answer="Yes. A project may involve only one service, or it may combine a website, automation, and internal software."
          />

          <FAQItem
            question="Do you work with specific industries?"
            answer="No. We work with small and medium businesses based on the problems they need to solve rather than their industry."
          />

          <FAQItem
            question="What kinds of projects are not a good fit?"
            answer="We are not currently focused on large enterprise platforms, mass-market consumer applications, complex e-commerce ecosystems, or projects that require replacing an entire established software infrastructure."
          />

        </div>

      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="faq-section alt">
      <div class="container">

        <div class="faq-section-heading">
          <h2>Process and collaboration</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-group">

          <FAQItem
            question="Do I need technical knowledge?"
            answer="No. Our role is to translate the business problem into a practical technical solution."
          />

          <FAQItem
            question="How does a project begin?"
            answer="Projects begin through the contact form. Tell us about your business, the current process or system, and what you want to improve."
          />

          <FAQItem
            question="Will I be involved during the build?"
            answer="Yes. Projects are collaborative. We gather feedback throughout the build instead of waiting until the end."
          />

          <FAQItem
            question="How long does a project take?"
            answer="The timeline depends on the scope. A focused website or automation may take a few weeks, while larger custom software projects may require a phased build."
          />

          <FAQItem
            question="Do you provide ongoing support?"
            answer="Yes. Support can include website maintenance, workflow monitoring, software improvements, troubleshooting, and continued development."
          />

        </div>

      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="faq-section">
      <div class="container">

        <div class="faq-section-heading">
          <h2>Pricing and ownership</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-group">

          <FAQItem
            question="How much does a project cost?"
            answer="Website Development starts at $1,500, AI Systems & Automation starts at $1,500, and Custom Internal Software starts at $2,000. Final pricing depends on project scope."
          />

          <FAQItem
            question="Why do you show starting prices instead of fixed packages?"
            answer="Every business is different. Starting prices communicate the general investment while allowing us to tailor each proposal."
          />

          <FAQItem
            question="Will I own what you build?"
            answer="Yes. Clients retain ownership of their website, software, source code, and business data."
          />

          <FAQItem
            question="Will I be locked into Static Pulse Sites?"
            answer="No. Our goal is to create systems you own and understand—not systems that force you to remain with us."
          />

          <FAQItem
            question="Will I need third-party subscriptions?"
            answer="Possibly. Hosting, automation platforms, AI services, databases, or email providers may have their own subscription costs."
          />

        </div>

      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="faq-section alt">
      <div class="container">

        <div class="faq-section-heading">
          <h2>Websites, AI and software</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-group">

          <FAQItem
            question="Do you only build static websites?"
            answer="Static websites remain our preferred solution for many businesses because they are fast, secure, and low maintenance. However, every project is evaluated individually."
          />

          <FAQItem
            question="Do you add AI to every project?"
            answer="No. AI is only introduced when it provides practical value."
          />

          <FAQItem
            question="Can you connect tools we already use?"
            answer="Yes, whenever the platforms provide suitable APIs or integrations."
          />

          <FAQItem
            question="Can you build a custom CRM or portal?"
            answer="Yes. We build CRMs, dashboards, onboarding systems, client portals, document systems, and other internal software."
          />

          <FAQItem
            question="Is any software completely secure?"
            answer="No. We build with security in mind and reduce unnecessary risk, but no responsible provider can guarantee absolute security."
          />

        </div>

      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="faq-final">
      <div class="container">

        <div class="faq-cta">

          <h2>Still unsure where to begin?</h2>

          <p>
            Describe what's slowing your business down and we'll help determine
            the simplest solution.
          </p>

          <div class="button-row">
            <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/contact">
              Start Your Project
            </a>
          </div>

        </div>

      </div>
    </section>

  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
.faq-page{
    overflow:hidden;
}

.faq-hero{
    padding:3.5rem 0 2.5rem;
}

.faq-hero-content{
    max-width:900px;
    text-align:center;
}

.faq-hero-content h1{
    max-width:850px;
    margin:0 auto;
}

.faq-hero-content p{
    max-width:760px;
    margin:1.2rem auto 0;
    line-height:1.7;
    font-size:1.1rem;
}

.button-row{
    display:flex;
    justify-content:center;
    margin-top:1.8rem;
}

.faq-section{
    padding:2.75rem 0;
}

.faq-section.alt{
    background:rgba(255,255,255,.018);
    border-top:1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--color-border);
}

.faq-section-heading{
    text-align:center;
    margin-bottom:2.25rem;
}

.faq-section-heading h2{
    margin:0;
}

.faq-group{
    max-width:900px;
    margin:auto;
}

.faq-final{
    padding:2.5rem 0 4rem;
}

.faq-cta{
    max-width:1000px;
    margin:auto;
    text-align:center;

    padding:3rem;

    border:1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius:28px;

    background:
    radial-gradient(circle at top right,
    rgba(6,182,212,.10),
    transparent 38%),
    linear-gradient(
    180deg,
    rgba(255,255,255,.04),
    rgba(255,255,255,.015));
}

.faq-cta p{
    max-width:700px;
    margin:1rem auto 0;
    line-height:1.7;
}

@media(max-width:768px){

.faq-section{
    padding:2.25rem 0;
}

.faq-cta{
    padding:2rem 1.5rem;
    border-radius:22px;
}

}
</style>